{"id":"wb-1-120","name":"杜甫草堂","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"杜甫草堂","text":"杜甫草堂，又名杜甫草堂博物馆，位于中华人民共和国四川省成都市青羊区草堂街道青华路38号，浣花溪公园旁，占地24公顷居住于。1961年3月4日公布为第一批全国重点文物保护单位，2006年12月被中国国家旅游局评为国家4A级旅游景区。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E6%9D%9C%E7%94%AB%E8%8D%89%E5%A0%82","revisionId":93618760,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=93618760","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/9ae7a43981d84538923a4736.jpg","title":"Du_Fu_cao_tang.jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Du_Fu_cao_tang.jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/e/e1/Du_Fu_cao_tang.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"User:唐戈","license":"CC BY-SA 3.0","licenseUrl":"http://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/3.0/","caption":"成都杜甫草堂；The Thatched Cottage of Du Fu in Chengdu","width":320,"height":213}}